#: ../../source/docs/modules/firmware.rst:3 6b05250043c24ad18ca416828e1446da
msgid "Firmware Management"
msgstr "固件管理"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/firmware.rst:9 7773e1260ed74cc7a2448ed09d024b09
msgid ""
"The firmware module provides downloading and listing of available ArduPilot "
"firmware."
msgstr "固件模块提供 ArduPilot 固件的下载和列表功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/firmware.rst:12 72728dc62da046f5b9663033551c6430
msgid "List"
msgstr "列表"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/firmware.rst:14 eb66115b14754c62bd01beb3394261fc
msgid "Download the list of available firmware:"
msgstr "下载可用固件列表："

#: ../../source/docs/modules/firmware.rst:20 25895c2502214114888e20de7ad6f773
msgid "Prints out the available latest firmwares:"
msgstr "打印可用的最新固件列表："

#: ../../source/docs/modules/firmware.rst:26 4348bea90e8349418b9506840a32ad7d
msgid ""
"Use ``FILTERS`` to filter the columns. An example would be "
"``platform=PX4-v2`` to only list the firmware for the PX4-V2 platform. "
"Another example would be ``releasetype=OFFICIAL frame=quad platform=PX4-v2``"
" to only list the most recent official firmware for quadcopters for the "
"PX4-v2 platform."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``FILTERS`` 过滤列。例如 ``platform=PX4-v2`` 仅列出 PX4-V2 "
"平台的固件；``releasetype=OFFICIAL frame=quad platform=PX4-v2`` 仅列出 PX4-v2 "
"平台四旋翼最新官方固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/firmware.rst:32 cd2e142f8dda48cd93772813cea7270d
msgid "Download"
msgstr "下载"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/firmware.rst:34 6f341d25516a4f128bc86ea915adf98a
msgid ""
"Download the specified firmware. It uses the same ``FILTERS`` as fw list."
msgstr "下载指定固件，使用与 fw list 相同的 ``FILTERS``。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/firmware.rst:42 9d888a4673bb451295535cf9bd980e8a
msgid "Flash"
msgstr "烧录"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/firmware.rst:44 57944d7bc4874db682ec5534d880a1e7
msgid ""
"Flash the specified firmware specified by ``FILENAME``. Requires ArduPilot's"
" ``uploader.py`` to be on the system path."
msgstr "烧录由 ``FILENAME`` 指定的固件。需要 ArduPilot 的 ``uploader.py`` 位于系统路径中。"
